+# Operational-record follow-up: five requested bundles
+
+October26,2026. The supplied S001-S014 summary is a request/claim inventory,
+not independent evidence. This pass interprets the request as pursuing its
+five original-record bundles through existing holdings and public sources.
+
+1. Bank/carrier originals behind Ex550/FBI8057, KSA Ex91/FBI2808-09 and Ex12A.
+   A separate bank-phone-records study already exists in this worktree. Read
+   its public-source acquisitions without modifying it or assuming its unfinished
+   conclusions are verified.
+2. Complete Bayoumi/BIN DON/Morgan witness records, identity/alias crosswalk and
+   Ex120/112/92/450, distinguishing full transcripts from quoted excerpts.
+3. Original CIA draft/hold/routing/access and delivery records; later oversight
+   searches. Keep deliberate hold, unexplained purpose and plot knowledge separate.
+4. Informant contacts/evaluations, payment authorization/voucher and closure.
+   Preserve reported noncomplicity, interview limitations and unknown payment purpose.
+5. Ex678M/MPS696_1-7, its FBI/color-photo equivalents, seizure/return records,
+   complete mathematical context and competing interpretations.
+
+Deliver a source/target crosswalk, bounded findings with exact pages/paragraphs,
+requirements checklist, baseline preservation hashes and a Git text-addition
+diff. Reuse public held originals without changing them. New originals are
+downloaded only from authorized public endpoints and pinned. Selected native
+pages must be visually inspected before newly relying on their layout/content;
+OCR is a locator. Use the verified Intel helper for raster output.
+
+Acceptance: each bundle distinguishes an acquired original, reproduced excerpt,
+official/party narrative, discovery lead and unavailable input; all material
+conflicting records and adverse evidence survive; no duplicate summary is counted
+as independent corroboration. A failed search is not a nonexistence finding.
+
+This pass is local research. No paid access, third-party contact, new FOIA,
+private correspondence, case-record edits, source repair, deletion or publication
+is included. Preserve the preceding published and local studies. Publication
+requires a separately reviewed public package; no current push is claimed.
